    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_shader" kindref="compound">Shader</ref> source model — owns the live ValueTree of raw GLSL source strings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads shader pass files (Common, Image, BufferA-D) from the active shader project directory. Each present file becomes a child tree with the source string stored as a property. Mirrors <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_theme" kindref="compound">config::Theme</ref> lifecycle. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
